  "title": "A camera, a thermostat and a river are not conscious",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "87aac53e-3858-4112-b869-46461c185bef",
      "text": "A camera has structure without persistence or stakes, and a thermostat has consequences without persistence or independent structure. A river has genealogical continuity and structure but is not altered for itself by its own flowing, so it is geography, not mind.",
